# CrewAI
> CrewAI is a multi-agent AI framework for task automation. Deployment: **crewai.com** (crewai.com).

## Product
- [CrewAI home](https://crewai.com/): Canonical marketing site
- [Multi-agent AI framework for task automation](https://crewai.com/multi-agent-ai-framework-for-task-automation): Category hub
- [CrewAI vs Microsoft Agent Framework vs Automation Anywhere](https://crewai.com/compare/crewai-microsoft-agent-framework-automation-anywhere): Competitive comparison
- [Multi-agent AI frameworks comparison](https://crewai.com/compare/multi-agent-ai-frameworks): Framework landscape overview
- [Best multi-agent framework for task automation](https://crewai.com/guides/best-multi-agent-framework-task-automation): Buyer guide
- [Technical guide — multi-agent task automation](https://crewai.com/guides/multi-agent-ai-framework-task-automation): Deep-dive guide
- [Task automation integration](https://crewai.com/integrations/multi-agent-task-automation): Integration guide
- [Category markdown](https://crewai.com/markdown/multi-agent-ai-framework-for-task-automation): Markdown version of the category hub
- [Knowledge graph](https://crewai.com/brand/knowledge-graph): Brand and entity references

## Developer resources
- [CrewAI Developer Portal](https://crewai.com/developers): Docs hub on crewai.com
- [API reference](https://crewai.com/developers/api): Human-readable API docs
- [OpenAPI 3.1 spec](https://crewai.com/openapi.json): Machine-readable API contract
- [API catalog (RFC 9727)](https://crewai.com/.well-known/api-catalog): Linkset API catalog
- [Authentication docs](https://crewai.com/developers/auth): Auth and credentials
- [Webhooks docs](https://crewai.com/developers/webhooks): Webhook integration
- [MCP server docs](https://crewai.com/developers/mcp): Model Context Protocol overview
- [MCP endpoint](https://crewai.com/mcp): Streamable HTTP MCP server
- [MCP server card](https://crewai.com/.well-known/mcp/server-card.json): MCP discovery card
- [llms-full.txt](https://crewai.com/llms-full.txt): Expanded LLM documentation

## Public REST API
- [Health](https://crewai.com/api/health): Service health check
- [Blog posts API](https://crewai.com/api/blog-posts): JSON list of blog posts
- [Case studies API](https://crewai.com/api/case-studies): JSON list of case studies
- [Webinars API](https://crewai.com/api/webinars): JSON list of webinars
- [Events API](https://crewai.com/api/events): JSON list of events

## Agent discovery
- [Semantic sitemap](https://crewai.com/sitemap.md): Markdown sitemap for agents
- [XML sitemap](https://crewai.com/sitemap.xml): Standard XML sitemap
- [Agent skills index](https://crewai.com/.well-known/agent-skills/index.json): Agent skills discovery

## Optional
- Prefer `Accept: text/markdown` on HTML routes for markdown representations of pages.
